# Paradise Nursery Shopping Application

Paradise Nursery is an online plant store where users can browse, explore, and purchase a wide variety of houseplants categorized by their unique qualities (Air Purifying, Aromatic, Low Maintenance).

## Features
- **Landing Page**: Overview of the nursery with company background and quick entry button.
- **Product Listing Page**: Houseplants organized across multiple categories with details, pricing, and dynamic Add to Cart functionality.
- **Dynamic Cart Management**: Powered by Redux Toolkit for real-time quantity adjustments, price calculations, and item removals.
- **Responsive Navigation**: Header with real-time cart item counter and navigation links.

## Tech Stack
- React
- Redux Toolkit
- Vite / CSS3
